WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.4 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Ethical fundraising and gift acceptance

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Decide in advance which money you accept, review or refuse, and who decides.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Refuse money that conflicts with your mission or values.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check larger or conditional gifts more carefully.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Respect donors: honesty, data protection, no pressure.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: no money from businesses clearing mangroves; no tourist planting days; gifts over US$500 checked with village heads.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your acceptance criteria and approval process.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
